# Workflow and Security Rules

- Do not modify workflows unless the task explicitly requires it.
- Refresh action versions from official GitHub releases or tags before changing pins, and pin by full commit SHA.
- Use the security docs and code-scanning runbooks before changing scanner or workflow logic.
- Do not bind pure CI jobs to GitHub Actions environments unless you intentionally want deployment records for that workflow.
